      "content": "1. India Geography Superlatives"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Geographical superlatives and Biosphere Reserves form high-yield core revision material for Indian exams.",
        "Strategic maritime geography includes critical Straits, Channels, and Gulfs around the Indian subcontinent.",
        "Ultra-important passes serve as essential transportation and defense corridors through major mountain ranges.",
        "National Parks and Biosphere Reserves are key indicators for biodiversity and environmental conservation studies.",
        "Economic and physical geography rely heavily on understanding Agriculture Facts, Mineral Belts, and Disaster-Prone Areas."
      ],
